    "combo2": {
      "title": "Kale's Toon Synchro/Link Bridge into Red-Eyes Toon Dragon",
      "description": "A go-first line built on the Jet Synchron / Crystron Halqifibrax engine, bridging through Linkuriboh, Linkross, and Barricadeborg Blocker into Mecha Phantom Beast Auroradon. Auroradon floods the field with Deskbot 001 copies and Mecha Phantom Beast O-Lion to Synchro Summon Accel Synchron, then bridges further into Borreload Savage Dragon and Herald of the Arc Light. Toon Kingdom closes out the turn, banishing Toon Mermaid, Toon Dark Magician, and a hand monster to Special Summon Red-Eyes Toon Dragon.",
